/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
483 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A: First, ensure the headset is charged and powered on. Check that Bluetooth is enabled on your computer. Make sure you've installed Emotiv software and created an account. If problems persist, try restarting both the headset and your computer, or try a different USB port for the dongle.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
484 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 156 0 R
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [17]
