endobj
485 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Q: My Emotiv headset isn't connecting to the software. What should I do?)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
486 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A: Check the electrode contact quality in the Emotiv software. Poor contact quality \(orange or red indicators\) will prevent proper signal detection. Try readjusting the headset, moistening the sensors slightly, or ensuring there's no hair between the sensors and your scalp.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
