/K [7]
>>
endobj
489 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A: You'll need to enter a profile name when starting the system. If you're using this for the first time, we recommend creating a new profile in the Emotiv software first and training your mental commands \(push, pull\) before using NeuroWarn.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [8]
>>
